SCOPE OF THE ABOVE

The MIT licence above covers only what the 1.6 rewrite produced:

  - Patches/ADSPatch.xml, which is new work rather than a corrected copy. The
    original's four operations targeted recipe names A Dog Said replaced in
    2023, through a predicate that in fact matched every recipe in the game;
    none of that survives here. What ships is one operation against A Dog
    Said 2's three animal categories.
  - the About.xml metadata, including the load-order declaration
  - the packaging and the documentation

IT DOES NOT COVER THE ORIGINAL MOD, and it does not cover the mods this one
patches.

akairo's Pomeranian - A Dog Said Patch is the mod this replaces:

  https://steamcommunity.com/sharedfiles/filedetails/?id=2020237999

akairo never declared a licence for it, so none is granted here and none can
be. It is superseded here under the usual practice for abandoned mods -
explicit credit, a link to the original, and removal on request.
The historical About/Preview.png was akairo's own and remains excluded from
MIT. That image has been removed from the current working package. New artwork
is not included in the above licence scope by this migration.

If akairo asks for this to be taken down, it comes down. Immediately, and
without discussion.

Nothing belonging to the two mods this one depends on is redistributed here.
aka_Pomeranian is akairo's, and is defined by Pomeranian Continued
(3682979759, maintained by Bernau31). ADS_Cat1, ADS_Cat2 and ADS_Cat3 are
SamBucher's, and are defined by A Dog Said... Animal Prosthetics 2
(3238353862). This mod only names them.

ATTRIBUTION.md records what was taken and what was changed.
